                                                "sense_id": "ab1298be-42d7-35ac-8089-1a90b2e90cc1",
                                                "text": "[…] to support or agree with the persecutions, beatings, dehumanizings, insults, murders, genocides, and oppressions of a perpetrator's target […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05015fc5-e1d6-4735-8b84-9b7bfc6bd6e5",
                                                "sense_id": "ab1298be-42d7-35ac-8089-1a90b2e90cc1",
                                                "text": "“It was one of the most severe beatings they’ve seen on tape,” an FDNY insider said, recalling the reaction by brass who viewed video of the bloody fisticuffs."
                                            },
