                                                "sense_id": "64076668-3885-30c1-ade3-a0c890b7f44b",
                                                "text": "To increase United's pain, this was their first home defeat in any competition since April 2010, when they lost to Chelsea - but even that defeat, which effectively cost them the title, may not turn out to have the same long-term significance as this heavy beating."
